# Environment variable reference. Worker secrets live in apps/api/.dev.vars locally
# (see apps/api/.dev.vars.example) and are set with `wrangler secret put` in production.
#
# Secrets
#   BETTER_AUTH_SECRET   >= 32 random bytes (openssl rand -base64 32)
#
# Vars (wrangler.jsonc "vars")
#   ENVIRONMENT          development | production
#   APP_ORIGIN           Origin the SPA is served from, e.g. https://plyntiq.example
#   BETTER_AUTH_URL      Public base URL for auth links (same as APP_ORIGIN)
#
# CI / deploy (GitHub Actions secrets, M6)
#   CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN
#   CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID
